# The canonical origin. <Seo> writes <link rel="canonical">, og:url and the
# absolute og:image from this; without it the canonical follows whatever
# host served the page, which on a preview deployment points search engines
# at the preview. Update this, robots.txt, sitemap.xml and the JSON-LD block
# in index.html together when the real domain is ready.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://ola-landing-blue.vercel.app
